{"input": "Summarize the discussion about trend watching and appearance design.", "answers": ["The marketing put forward three noteworthy aspects in trends. First and foremost, people loved fancy things that they could be identified with. The second point was that as a remote control it had to be technologically innovative. Thirdly, being easy to use was also necessary. From a broader perspective, fruit and vegetables were in fashion this year and being spongy was also popular. Thus, contrary to the industrial designer, the marketing thought rubber was more feasible in terms of sponginess. The group agreed that the product should resemble fruit and vegetable in shape and colour but the specific design was not decided."], "length": 6957, "dataset": "qmsum", "pred": "The team discussed the importance of making the remote control look fancy and innovative, while also being easy to use. They considered various design options, including using titanium or spongy materials, and explored the idea of creating a shape that resembles fruit or vegetables. They also discussed the importance of having a small number of buttons and providing information about the actions of each button. The team decided to keep the L_C_D_ display and use two batteries. They also considered the trend of people changing their T_V_ more often than their remote control batteries."}
