ussed the user interface and usability of the device and decided on a final design. They also discussed the costs and decided to make some changes to the design to make it more affordable. The team decided to use a titanium back and a plastic front, and to use a simple chip instead of an advanced chip. They also decided to use a beamer instead of a SMARTboard."}
